# Dolibarr language file - en_US - facturx
ModuleFacturXName = Factur-X
ModuleFacturXDesc = Generate customer invoices in Factur-X format (PDF/A-3 with embedded CII XML, EXTENDED profile)
FacturXDescription = Generate customer invoices in Factur-X format
FacturXDescriptionLong = Adds a PDF template for customer invoices that produces a Factur-X compliant PDF/A-3 with embedded CII XML (EXTENDED profile).
PDFFacturxTemplate = Factur-X invoice template (PDF/A-3 + CII EXTENDED XML)

# Setup page
FacturXSetup = Factur-X module setup
FacturXSetupPageHelp = These settings feed the structured CII XML embedded in the Factur-X PDFs. They do not change the visual PDF: the footer is still driven by the free text under Invoices → Setup.
FacturXNotesTitle = French legal mentions (coded notes, BT-22)
FacturXNotesHelp = Notes required by the FNFE/CIUS-FR checks (rule BR-FR-05, one note per code — BR-FR-06). Only emitted when the selling company is French. Leave a field empty to use the default text shown greyed out.
FacturXNotePMD = Late-payment penalties (code PMD)
FacturXNotePMDHelp = Penalty rate applicable in case of late payment.
FacturXNotePMT = Recovery cost indemnity (code PMT)
FacturXNotePMTHelp = Fixed 40 € indemnity due on late payment (B2B).
FacturXNoteAAB = Early-payment discount (code AAB)
FacturXNoteAABHelp = Discount terms for early payment, or the absence of any discount.
FacturXNoteTXD = Single VAT group (code TXD)
FacturXNoteTXDHelp = Only if your company belongs to a single VAT group. Empty = note not emitted.
FacturXNoteNoDefault = (no default — empty means the note is not emitted)
FacturXEndpointTitle = Seller electronic address (BT-34)
FacturXEndpointHelp = Routing identifier used by the platform directory (French 2026 reform). Default: your SIREN with scheme 0225. The buyer address (BT-49) is derived automatically from the thirdparty card (SIREN, else e-mail).
FacturXSellerEndpointId = Electronic address value
FacturXSellerEndpointIdHelp = Empty = company SIREN (greyed out). Set e.g. SIREN_XXXX to append a routing code.
FacturXSellerEndpointScheme = Scheme identifier (schemeID)
FacturXSellerEndpointSchemeHelp = Empty = 0225 (SIREN, French reform). Use EM for an e-mail address.
